{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"lean-body-mass-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"sv","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"lean-body-mass-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["lean-body-mass-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"sv","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Den uppskattar fettfri kroppsmassa från längd och vikt med hjälp av en publicerad ekvation för män eller kvinnor.Det kan skilja sig från en individuell mätning, så behandla det som en grov uppskattning.","record_id":"ee616155ea06d87d3e6d78294ad7f782660ea3fc9ebbe7df819bbaf632010418","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":0.6451150698750325,"source":"It estimates lean body mass from height and weight using a published equation set for men or women. It can differ from an individual measurement, so treat it as a rough estimate.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"fe25881ef26cbd5da19c86fc8f76157af7e9711e1b40a2221e6ce84d2574b61c","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Den uppskattar fettfri kroppsmassa från längd och vikt med hjälp av en publicerad ekvation för män eller kvinnor.Det kan skilja sig från en individuell mätning, så behandla det som en grov uppskattning.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.example","detected_language":"sv","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.example","keys":["norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.example"],"locale":"sv","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ange den totala årslönen, välj arbetsgivarens registrerade avgiftszon och verksamhetstyp och lägg sedan till semesterlön, pension och andra ersättningar.Till exempel ZXQPH0000QXZ NOK i avgiftsbas i zon I ger ZXQPH0001QXZ NOK i arbetsgivaravgift vid ZXQPH0002QXZ.","record_id":"ee113c96a4525570484db31f8a65b7ecba56a49ee4b322bdbec4ab4bb399f513","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.5791181038749755,"source":"Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"f30c769371f3acb43827634a4b139057c36d7da182d30717c996a403dd1b0030","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ange den totala årslönen, välj arbetsgivarens registrerade avgiftszon och verksamhetstyp och lägg sedan till semesterlön, pension och andra ersättningar.Till exempel 1,000,000 NOK i avgiftsbas i zon I ger 141,000 NOK i arbetsgivaravgift vid 14.1%.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
